  <h2>Stated non-goals</h2>

  <ul class="spaced">
    <li>Not a competing tensor or ML runtime. Candle is the dependency.</li>
    <li>
      Not a native cross-platform renderer in Phase 0 or 1. Dioxus interop
      first; a native renderer only if interop is proven insufficient.
    </li>
    <li>
      Not post-quantum cryptography. Named as a future research thread and
      deliberately kept out of this charter's scope.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The RFCs</h2>

  <p>
    These are the design record, and they are the thing to read before the code.
  </p>

  <div class="scroller">
    <table>
      <thead>
